 "notes": "Nylon String Guitar (GM program 25) from FluidR3_GM.sf2 (Frank Wen, MIT license), rendered note by note with FluidSynth 2.3 at 44.1 kHz with reverb and chorus off, velocity 100, held 4 s. 16 notes E2-C#6 every minor third. Trimmed to the attack, faded once the note is 62 dB down (max 4.5 s), first 0.25 s loudness evened across the range, peak -1 dBFS, mono, LAME VBR V2. Replaces the University of Iowa recording, which had low-frequency rumble, a high noise floor and a muffled tone.",
